  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Sorted and rotated\n\nGiven an array of N distinct integers. the task is to write a program to check if this array is sorted and rotated. A sorted array is not considered as sorted and rotated , i.e there should at least one rotation.",
    "constraints": [
      "1 <= N <= 10^5"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "The first line has an integer N denotes the size of the array.\n\nThe second line contains N values separated by space.",
    "outputFormat": "print Yes/No",
